// graduation counter festival:harvest pays a decoration present through data/achievements.json. The calendar only sets the
// default — any festival can be switched on by hand (/festival <key>), so nothing here can be missed. Generated from the
// maintainer's texts; the twelve other languages come from tools/translate_locale.py. #3023: every harvested plant counts
